      </div>
      <p class="dc-intro-lead"><strong>D.Core massage chairs are not built to impress at first glance.</strong> They are built to be lived with — to settle into the corner of a considered room, to become part of a nightly ritual, and to deliver an experience that feels <em>organic, calm, and genuinely therapeutic</em> every single session.</p>
      <p style="font-size:16px !important;color:var(--dc-muted);max-width:820px;margin-bottom:48px;line-height:1.85">Where some massage chair brands compete on spectacle, D.Core takes a quieter approach. The chairs are built around patented True Shiatsu Action: a mechanism designed to simulate the real finger structure and organic movement patterns of a massage therapist. Combined with furniture-grade walnut trim, Wave Arrays that address your arms and legs simultaneously, and a design sensibility that sits closer to a beautiful recliner than a wellness appliance, D.Core represents a specific kind of premium ownership — one that rewards consistent use and a discerning eye.</p>
      <div class="dc-intro-pillars">
        <div class="dc-intro-pillar"><h3>🌿 Organic Design Sophistication</h3><p>Every D.Core chair is designed to belong in a living space — not to dominate it. Real black walnut trim, clean forms, and a refined finish make D.Core chairs feel like furniture that happens to deliver a world-class massage.</p></div>
        <div class="dc-intro-pillar"><h3>• Therapist-Like True Shiatsu</h3><p>D.Core's patented True Shiatsu Action mechanism is built to simulate the finger structure and organic movement of a trained shiatsu practitioner — not simply a roller moving in a pattern. The result feels more deliberate, more human, and more satisfying session after session.</p></div>
        <div class="dc-intro-pillar"><h3>↯ Quiet Luxury Ownership</h3><p>This is not the most aggressive brand. D.Core is for buyers who have moved past the need to be impressed, and simply want something that works beautifully — every day, in their home, on their terms.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

