          <div class="dc-exp-panel"><div class="dc-exp-num">01 — TRUE SHIATSU ACTION</div><h3>The Press That Feels Like a Hand</h3><p>D.Core's True Shiatsu mechanism thinks before it moves — varying the angle, the pressure, and the rhythm in a way that mirrors how a therapist's thumbs navigate the trapezius differently from the lumbar. You'll notice in the first minute: this doesn't feel like a machine running a program.</p></div>
          <div class="dc-exp-panel"><div class="dc-exp-num">02 — WAVE ARRAYS</div><h3>Your Arms and Calves Feel Included</h3><p>D.Core's Wave Arrays create mechanical massage movement in your forearms and calves — real engagement, not decorative compression. By the time a session ends, your whole body has been addressed, not just your spine.</p></div>
          <div class="dc-exp-panel"><div class="dc-exp-num">03 — ZERO GRAVITY RECLINE</div><h3>The Moment Your Body Stops Holding</h3><p>Zero gravity recline elevates your knees above your heart. Your muscles stop holding and allow the massage to actually reach deeper tissue. Buyers with back pain describe the transition as immediate and profound.</p></div>
          <div class="dc-exp-panel"><div class="dc-exp-num">04 — HEATED BACK MASSAGE</div><h3>Warmth That Prepares the Muscle</h3><p>Gentle lumbar heat prepares tight muscles to receive pressure rather than resist it. Starting a D.Core session with heat shortens the "warm-up" phase dramatically. By minute three, you're already in the productive part of the session.</p></div>
