  <section class="dc-section" id="dc-faq">
    <div class="dc-container-narrow">
      <div class="dc-section-header">
        <span class="dc-eyebrow">Frequently Asked Questions</span>
        <h2 class="dc-accent-heading">D.Core Massage Chair FAQ</h2>
        <p>Real buyer questions. Honest answers. Everything you need to buy confidently.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="dc-faq-list">
        <div class="dc-faq-item"><div class="dc-faq-q" onclick="dcToggleFaq(this)"><h3>What makes D.Core massage chairs different from standard premium chairs?</h3><span class="dc-faq-toggle">+</span></div><div class="dc-faq-a"><div class="dc-faq-a-inner"><p>D.Core's core differentiator is its patented True Shiatsu Action mechanism — designed to simulate the actual finger structure and organic movement patterns of a shiatsu therapist, rather than simply rolling across a pre-set path. Combined with Wave Arrays that engage arms and legs during a session, real black walnut trim, and a design philosophy that prioritizes home integration over visual noise, D.Core occupies a distinct space between purely therapeutic brands and purely design-led brands.</p></div></div></div>
        <div class="dc-faq-item"><div class="dc-faq-q" onclick="dcToggleFaq(this)"><h3>How does the D Core 2 compare to the Cirrus JP and Stratus JP?</h3><span class="dc-faq-toggle">+</span></div><div class="dc-faq-a"><div class="dc-faq-a-inner"><p>The D Core 2 ($14,999) leads the lineup with a 10-roller mechanism, advanced guided stretch programs with shoulder stabilization, airbag kneading in the shoulders and lower legs, and a touchscreen remote. The Cirrus JP ($12,999) focuses on simultaneous arm and leg Wave Array engagement, a front sliding system for space-efficient placement, and color choice (Black or Pearl). The Stratus JP ($11,499) is the balanced entry — 3D+ True Shiatsu, forearm Wave Arrays, heated back massage, zero gravity, 20 air cells, foot rollers, and real walnut trim.</p></div></div></div>
        <div class="dc-faq-item"><div class="dc-faq-q" onclick="dcToggleFaq(this)"><h3>Is a D.Core massage chair suitable for daily use?</h3><span class="dc-faq-toggle">+</span></div><div class="dc-faq-a"><div class="dc-faq-a-inner"><p>Yes — D.Core chairs are built for consistent daily use. The True Shiatsu Action mechanism, automatic programs, and balanced pressure delivery are specifically designed to produce a rewarding session every day rather than an intense one-off experience. Many D.Core owners describe the chair as part of their pre-sleep or post-work ritual.</p></div></div></div>
        <div class="dc-faq-item"><div class="dc-faq-q" onclick="dcToggleFaq(this)"><h3>What is True Shiatsu Action and why does it matter?</h3><span class="dc-faq-toggle">+</span></div><div class="dc-faq-a"><div class="dc-faq-a-inner"><p>True Shiatsu Action is D.Core's patented massage mechanism, designed to simulate the finger structure and organic movement of a trained shiatsu practitioner — not a simple rolling pattern. A standard roller moves predictably across a fixed path. True Shiatsu Action creates a more deliberate "press and work" rhythm, varying the point of contact and pressure angle in a way that mirrors how a therapist's thumbs navigate different muscle groups.</p></div></div></div>
        <div class="dc-faq-item"><div class="dc-faq-q" onclick="dcToggleFaq(this)"><h3>The D.Core Cirrus JP has a front sliding system — what does that mean?</h3><span class="dc-faq-toggle">+</span></div><div class="dc-faq-a"><div class="dc-faq-a-inner"><p>The front sliding system means the Cirrus JP slides forward on its base as it reclines, rather than simply tilting backward. This dramatically reduces the amount of open space you need behind the chair for it to recline fully — making it possible to place the chair much closer to a wall than a standard reclining massage chair would allow.</p></div></div></div>
        <div class="dc-faq-item"><div class="dc-faq-q" onclick="dcToggleFaq(this)"><h3>Does D.Core offer financing?</h3><span class="dc-faq-toggle">+</span></div><div class="dc-faq-a"><div class="dc-faq-a-inner"><p>Yes — D.Core massage chairs at Massage Chairs and More are available with Affirm financing, which allows you to spread the cost over manageable monthly payments. Speak with our team for current rates and available terms.</p></div></div></div>
        <div class="dc-faq-item"><div class="dc-faq-q" onclick="dcToggleFaq(this)"><h3>Where can I try D.Core massage chairs before buying?</h3><span class="dc-faq-toggle">+</span></div><div class="dc-faq-a"><div class="dc-faq-a-inner"><p>You can experience every D.Core model at the Massage Chairs and More showroom in the San Jose / Pleasanton, California area. Our specialists will guide you through a structured session comparison — matching each model to your specific priorities, room, body type, and wellness goals. Book an appointment online or call {{ section.settings.phone | default: '+1 (408) 889-1188' }}.</p></div></div></div>
        <div class="dc-faq-item"><div class="dc-faq-q" onclick="dcToggleFaq(this)"><h3>Why should I buy from Massage Chairs and More rather than directly online?</h3><span class="dc-faq-toggle">+</span></div><div class="dc-faq-a"><div class="dc-faq-a-inner"><p>Massage chair comfort is extremely personal. Buying from Massage Chairs and More gives you access to in-person showroom comparison, a specialist who understands the full D.Core lineup, extended warranty options, white-glove delivery, and ongoing support after purchase. For a chair at this price point, the experience of deciding with your body rather than with a specification list is invaluable.</p></div></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
